title: TutorialManager_PostBrew
---
<<lock>>
<<setRepeatNode "TutorialManager_PostBrew_Repeat">>
PHYLL: Great job! You can INSPECT your potion to see what you made.
PHYLL: Feel free to explore lots of different combinations to get something that'll really solve my problem.
PHYLL: When you're happy with your potion, drop it on the platform with the red circle and I'll take a look.
<<unlock>>
<<stop>>
