title: TutorialManager_Ending
---
<<setNormal>>
<<if $potion_quality == "arousal">>
<<setsprite "Phyll" "manager sad">>
    PHYLL: What's… this feeling??
    PHYLL: Urghh… my head…
    PHYLL: All I can think about is… elf abs… and elf arrows…
    PHYLL: Long, piercing, elf arrows…
<<setsprite "Phyll" "manager happy">>
    PHYLL: LILY!! I GOTTA GO FIND MY BOYFRIEND.
    PHYLL: YOU'RE IN CHARGE WHILE I'M GONE.
    PHYLL: DON'T CALL ME. DON'T TEXT ME. I'LL BE BUSY.
    PHYLL: I'M COMING POOKIEEEEEEEE
    ...
    I think that went well.
    <<loadGameplay>>
<<elseif $potion_quality == "wakefulness">>
<<setsprite "Phyll" "manager happy">>
    PHYLL: This was exactly what I was looking for! Wow, you're a natural!
    PHYLL: Thanks Lily! Now I'll be able to stay awake on the drive home. My boyfriend will be thrilled.
    PHYLL: I'll leave you to it, then. If you need anything, I'll be in the back.
    <<loadGameplay>>
<<else>>
<<setsprite "Phyll" "manager sad">>
    PHYLL: Hm, this isn't exactly what I'm looking for…
    PHYLL: Good effort anyway, Lily! 
    PHYLL: I'm sure there are some limitations with our ingredients that your Barvard-educated brain isn't used to.
    PHYLL: I'll leave you to it, then. If you need anything, I'll be in the back.
    <<loadGameplay>>
<<endif>>
===

title: TutorialManager_Check
---
<<setInternal>>
It's Phyll Kloro. My favorite manager. Yup.
Phyll somehow has the HOTTEST elf boyfriend I've ever seen.
I mean, Treeples reproduce through pollination, so they don't have much libido at all.
And Phyll's solution to this problem… is letting his boyfriend have all the affairs he wants.
He plays it cool, but I can tell it bothers him.
If I wanna help him out, I probably need to make something to get him... <color="red">aroused</color> I guess.
Those <color="red">Wandoms</color> behind me might be a place to start.
<<setNormal>>
<<jump TutorialManager_PostCheck>>
<<stop>>
===

title: TutorialManager_GivePotion
---
<<lock>>
<<setInternal>>
-> Give Potion
    <<confirmGive>>
    <<jump TutorialManager_Ending>>
-> Don't Give
    <<cancelGive>>
<<unlock>>
<<stop>>
===